    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>You are a member of the @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.fc464242d84d4e34]{Camarilla} in good standing, believed to be the prodigal childe of a particularly insightful sire who was an advisor to the past prince. As such, you have status, prestige within your clan and two very big&mdash;and very dangerous&mdash;secrets. First, you are not really a @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.ZJx9H3XnU8yQGy9s]{Malkavian}, but merely passing as one; the real childe of the previous seer was a friend of yours among the anarchs who met Final Death at the hands of the @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.6868ee8c357f4b73]{Sabbat} almost a decade ago. Since her sire disappeared mysteriously a few years back, though, it's unlikely anyone will be able to call your bluff. Besides, the court was happy enough to have its previous advisor's favored childe return from hiatus to fill the void, and you are more than happy to oblige them. Second, you are not a @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.fc464242d84d4e34]{Camarilla} Kindred, you are an anarch, and have been since your Embrace almost three decades ago. You relish letting the arrogant Camarilla stooges believe they are pulling your strings, and pretend not to hear when they snicker at the suffering of the &ldquo;poor Lunatic.&rdquo; You've made yourself useful with a combination of pseudo-mystical pronouncements and cleverly couched information fed to the prince in the guise of &ldquo;prophecies&rdquo; that your fellow revolutionaries are only too happy to help ensure come to pass just often enough to keep the court listening to you. Your true value to the Movement has yet to come to light, however. For the time being you are a sleeper, quietly building the court's trust in you while waiting for a particularly inspired opportunity to buck the system and do some real damage before skipping town again.</p><h2>Stat Block (as printed)</h2><p><strong>Clan:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.SNuXttNqxzJ6uPXv]{Caitiff} (posing as @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.ZJx9H3XnU8yQGy9s]{Malkavian})<br><strong>Nature:</strong> Rebel<br><strong>Demeanor:</strong> Dabbler<br><strong>Generation:</strong> 10th</p><p><strong>Physical (8):</strong> Quick x2, Tough x2, Agile, Graceful x2, Robust, Delicate (N)<br><strong>Social (10):</strong> Seductive, Witty, Callous (N), Eloquent, Gorgeous x2, Charming, Commanding x2, Ingratiating<br><strong>Mental (12):</strong> Ambitious, Creative x3, Disciplined x2, Insightful, Knowledgeable x2, Reflective x2, Shrewd</p><p><strong>Abilities:</strong> Athletics, Expert Ability: Counterfeiting x4, Dodge x2, Melee x2, Performance (Acting) x2, Subterfuge x3, Occult, Politics x2, Intimidation</p><p><strong>Disciplines:</strong> Dominate (Command, Mesmerism, Forgetful Mind); Obfuscate (Cloak of Shadows, Unseen Presence, Mask of a Thousand Faces); Presence (Awe, Dread Gaze)</p><p><strong>Backgrounds:</strong> Allies x3, Resources x3, Herd, Influence: Bureaucracy x3, Influence: Church x2, Influence: High Society, Influence: Street x2, Influence: Law x2<br><strong>Merits:</strong> Daredevil, Personal Masquerade (Malkavian)<br><strong>Flaws:</strong> Dark Secret (Anarch spy)<br><strong>Virtues:</strong> Conscience 3, Self-Control 4, Courage 3<br><strong>Path:</strong> Humanity 3<br><strong>Reputation:</strong> Camarilla: Acknowledged, Cultured, Respected. Anarch: Committed, Bond (Girl)<br><strong>Blood:</strong> 13 (may spend 1/round)<br><strong>Willpower:</strong> 4</p>",
